// Signing for the iOS app. The team lives in Local.xcconfig (gitignored), so the repository
// names no account. For a run on a real iPhone, create clients/ios/Local.xcconfig with:
//   DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = <your team id>     (the same team as the Mac app)
//   CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic
// Without that file, simulator builds sign to run locally. A device build then needs the file,
// except `build.sh test`'s build for generic/platform=iOS, which turns signing off.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
